<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. The top bar's message rotator (announcement-rotator-v2) is
  defined in shopify/assets/live-header.js, loaded on every page by
  layout/theme.storelib, so a top bar redrawn in the builder rotates without
  an inline script. Kept so a saved render 'announcement-rotator' still works.
{%- endcomment -%}
</template>